- `ProfileView` - User profile
- `ComprehensiveCreatorStudioView` - Creator dashboard
- `ChampionshipHubView` - VS matches & belts
- `LiveStreamerAwardsView` - Streamer awards
- `AGIAgentDashboardView` - Admin AGI control

