Tool: Network Link Conditioner (Xcode → Additional Tools)

Profiles:
- 100% Loss (test offline mode)
- 3G (slow network)
- LTE (moderate network)
- Very Bad Network (packet loss + delay)
- WiFi (fast network)
- Custom (configure your own)

Test scenarios:
- App launch on slow network
- Image loading on 3G
- Video streaming quality adaptation
- Timeout handling
- Offline mode
- Request retry logic
```

