### 🚀 PERFORMANCE DEBUGGING CHECKLIST

Before shipping any feature, run through this checklist:

#### Memory ✅
- [ ] No retain cycles (use Instruments → Leaks)
- [ ] Proper deinit cleanup (log in deinit)
- [ ] Weak delegates and closures
